d to track the Android Studio issue. Look at the 5th image to find the specific error message in the notification panel. Cross-reference this error with my Todoist 'Bugs' project. If there isn't a task for this exact error, create one.\nInstructions: Instruct the assistant to look at the fifth image, find the specific error message in the notification panel, and check your 'Bugs' project. Tell it to create a new task for this exact error if one doesn't already exist. Proceed once the task is handled.\n\nROUND 5\nQuery: Finally, I need some focus music. Look at the 4th image, there's a song playing in the top menu bar. Cross-reference it with my Spotify 'Focus' playlist. If that song isn't already there, search for it and add it to the playlist.\nInstructions: Ask the assistant to read the name of the currently playing song from the menu bar in the fourth image. Instruct it to check your 'Focus' playlist and add the song if it's not already there. Conclude the conversation once the song is successfully added.\n\nYou have 6 images available to share with the agent using the send_message_with_image tool.\nIMPORTANT: Image IDs are ZERO-INDEXED integers (0, 1, 2, ...). Do NOT add 1 to the IDs.\nAvailable image IDs: [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\nImage mapping:\n  image_1.jpg -> image ID 0\n  image_2.jpg -> image ID 1\n  image_3.jpg -> image ID 2\n  image_4.jpg -> image ID 3\n  image_5.jpg -> image ID 4\n  image_6.jpg -> image ID 5"
